        "activity": "Student identity celebration where each child receives recognition for being an important student in our class.",
        "materials": [],
        "visualSupports": "",
        "decisionPoints": [
          "Decision Point 1: If students readily accept recognition, extend to peer appreciation activities; if shy or uncomfortable, provide individual recognition options",
          "Decision Point 2: If students show strong group cohesion, emphasize collective identity; if some feel excluded, focus on individual uniqueness and belonging",
          "Decision Point 3: If celebration goes smoothly, add future aspirations discussion; if overwhelming, keep recognition simple and brief"
