        "decisionPoints": [
          "Decision Point 1: If students easily guess job roles, extend to job purpose discussions; if struggling with concepts, use more concrete examples and demonstrations",
          "Decision Point 2: If students show curiosity about authority figures, emphasize helping and caring aspects; if show anxiety, focus on friendly and supportive roles",
